      "reason": "Inline RegexTokenizer.train pair counting for already-filtered chunks and combine chunk encoding with the length filter. This avoids a per-chunk helper call in the merge loop and skips building an intermediate list of too-short chunk id lists while preserving pair insertion order and learned merges."
